      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "When does the CPU Wait?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DGSOrZJHTcA4J5L5w6pSN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 584.5499648893228,
      "y": 618.5000001111111,
      "width": 585.2596435546875,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1312287059,
      "version": 989,
      "versionNonce": 2029859837,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791203667667,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Only when a call needs the GPU to have finished something:\n\n* copy a, coby b (from host) - waits for its copy\n* fill c with zeroed - no wait\n* launch the kernel - no wait (CPU is free)\n* copy c back (to_host_vec) - wait for kernel + copy\n\nThe queue lets the CPU add jobs and move on;\nthe GPU catches up.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Only when a call needs the GPU to have finished something:\n\n* copy a, coby b (from host) - waits for its copy\n* fill c with zeroed - no wait\n* launch the kernel - no wait (CPU is free)\n* copy c back (to_host_vec) - wait for kernel + copy\n\nThe queue lets the CPU add jobs and move on;\nthe GPU catches up.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
